# Model Routing (opencode-go landscape, ratified 2026-08-01, Hy3 primary 2026-08-25)

## Canonical relationship

This file is the always-injected routing policy. The live implementation lives in
`~/.omo/omo.jsonc` (agents map, categories map,
background_task.modelConcurrency). `opencode.jsonc` base model/small_model/agents are
untouched by routing. **Where this file and the config differ, the config wins** (it
executes); this file records intent so future edits stay justified.

## Routing table (agent → model → fallback)

| Agent | Model | Fallback |
|---|---|---|
| sisyphus / architect / build / worker | `opencode-go/hy3` | `gpt-5.6-luna → mimo-v2.5-free` |
| oracle / prometheus / metis / momus / ultrabrain | `opencode-go/hy3` | `gpt-5.6-luna → glm-5.2 → mimo-v2.5-free` |
| explore / scout / librarian / multimodal-looker / sisyphus-junior / writing / git / quick | `opencode-go/hy3` | `gpt-5.6-luna → mimo-v2.5-free` |
| test-writer / review | `opencode-go/gpt-5.6-luna` | `deepseek-v4-flash → minimax-m3 → mimo-v2.5-free` |
| hephaestus / atlas | `opencode-go/deepseek-v4-flash` | (existing; both disabled) |
| visual-engineering | `opencode-go/minimax-m3` | `deepseek-v4-flash → gpt-5.6-luna → mimo-v2.5-free` |
